  "step_3": "The information relevant to the decision reason — comparing the most probable outcomes and their probabilities — is not present in the verbal report. The individual does not identify or compare the most probable outcomes (e.g., 2400 Euros in both, but with different probabilities). Instead, the individual focuses on the 1% chance of getting nothing in B and the possibility of winning more. The justification is based on risk and potential gain, not on the rule of preferring the lottery with the more favorable most probable outcome. Therefore, the individual did not use the decision reason. The reasoning is inconsistent with the rule of the decision reason. There is no mention of comparing probabilities of the most favorable outcomes. Hence, the decision reason was not used.",
